--TEST--
an arm condition of a `match` over an enum is offered the cases no arm writes yet, and the case an arm already writes is left out,`rule:ide/completion-is-asked-where-a-spelling-ends`
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Priority { Low, Normal, High }

final class Labels
{
    public static function short(Priority $p): string
    {
        return match ($p) {
            Priority::Low => "low",
            <|>
        };
    }
}
--REQUEST--
completion prefix=Priority
--EXPECT--
Priority enum      Priority
Priority::High enumMember
Priority::Normal enumMember
